WEBVTT

00:01:00.056 --> 00:01:02.600
I recognized how connected we were.

00:01:03.101 --> 00:01:07.188
Oil price shocks
led to cereal price hikes,

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:10.900
which affected bread prices
all over the world.

00:01:11.234 --> 00:01:13.736
And the most vulnerable were hurt.

00:01:15.863 --> 00:01:18.825
Fourteen years later,
my impatience has grown.

00:01:19.617 --> 00:01:21.577
We’re even more connected,

00:01:21.577 --> 00:01:24.372
and our food ecosystem
is even more broken.

00:01:25.373 --> 00:01:28.543
Thankfully, the Rockefeller Foundation
has some pioneering research

00:01:28.584 --> 00:01:31.504
on the true cost of food
in the United States,